Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["3.2. Tensor trains", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"5dc1e7fd-c357-4360-9075-c554642bdf14"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[TextData[{
 "A tensor train (",
 StyleBox["\"TT\"", "Code"],
 ") is structurally an MPS without a physical dimension \[LongDash] useful \
for compressing arbitrary high-rank tensors as a chain of low-rank cores. The \
chain shape is the same (left bond, right bond per interior core) but every \
tensor lacks the physical leg. Compare the hyperedges: a 4-site tensor train \
has only the bond indices and no site labels."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"fe6de374-5d46-48de-99fa-e76e4523478b"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

